    72	"narrative">Seven weeks earlier, the committee had held the range at 3.50–3.75 percent by a 9–3 vote. The July minutes say most participants wanted more information before acting, 
    73	while several already favored a quarter-point increase.<sup class="src-ref"><a href="#src-6" data-record-href="/records/fomc-statement-2026-07-29/" data-passage="approved the follo
