   167	          <p>About two hours after the announcement, The Hill reported that President Donald Trump demanded rates of 1 percent or less and called for the Fed to lower them fast.<Cite s="the-hill-trump-fed-reaction-2026-09-16" passage="Interest Rates in the United States should be 1%, or less" /><Cite s="the-hill-trump-fed-reaction-2026-09-16" passage="Trump’s reaction came about two hours" /></p>
   168	        </SourcedBlock>
   169	
   170	        <p data-layer="narrative">Warsh described central-bank independence as “a two-way street” and said trade and fiscal policymakers should stay in their lane.<Cite s="the-hill-fed-decision-2026-09-16" passage="is a two-way street" /></p>
